  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お疲れ、灯織。……最近大丈夫か？\r\nいつも、遅くまで残っているようだけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001030650,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "あ……\r\n……お疲れ様です、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100103/4001001030650"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001030660,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "いえ……ふたりとも頑張っているので\r\n私も負けてられないと反省していました",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100103/4001001030660"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001030670,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "（……ふたりと上手くいっていないなんて\r\n……さすがに、言えない……）",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100103/4001001030670"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001030680,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……私の努力不足です\r\n３人の呼吸も、まだ上手く合わなくて",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100103/4001001030680"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……それなら、特別メニューを試してみようか\r\n明日、臨時レッスンをしよう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001030690,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "どんなレッスンでしょうか？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100103/4001001030690"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "明日のこの時間、レッスン場に来てくれ\r\nそうすればわかるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
